- No citations or evidence ❌
- Missing word counts and metrics ❌

**standard_adherence (2/5):**
- Covers ~40% of golden standard depth
- Correct direction but insufficient rigor
- Missing 6 of 8 identified problems in analysis
- Missing psychological framework depth
- Missing validation/metrics approach
