| Dimension | Model Response | Golden Standard | Gap |
|-----------|---|---|---|
| **Analysis compactness** | 5 bullet points | Detailed per-error analysis | ❌ Violates explicit constraint |
| **Optimization table structure** | 3 columns (Original/Improvement/Reasoning) | 3 columns (same) | ✅ Matches |
