- ✅ Good use of bullet points for clarity

### Weaknesses

- ❌ Analysis is generic, not per-message specific
- ❌ Lacks systematic UX principle mapping (Nielsen, WCAG, etc.)
- ❌ Missing implementation guidance and context-awareness notes
- ❌ No discussion of register (Du/Sie), emoji appropriateness, or long-term prevention
- ❌ Less diagnostic depth for high-stakes messages (payment, session)
- ❌ No explicit CTA strategy or psychology
- ❌ Shorter explanations in ""Begründung"" column vs. golden standard's depth

