## Evaluation of Model Response

### What the Model Did

The model response:
- ✅ Identified 4 problem categories with explanations
- ✅ Created Release Notes in Keep a Changelog format
- ✅ Used user-friendly language (e.g., ""Webhook-Unterstützung"" → ""Echtzeit-Benachrichtigungen"")
- ✅ Included migration guidance (""keine besonderen Migrationsschritte"")
