   - Linux: Generic statement without specific package manager commands

8. **Missing Context & Metadata:**
   - No target audience definition
   - No estimated time to completion
   - No contact information (Slack channel, maintainer)
   - No link to issue tracker
   - No ""next steps"" section with links to API docs, architecture, etc.

9. **Justification Too Brief:**
