   - Doesn't explain WHY each change improves onboarding (e.g., ""Prerequisites prevents installation problems"" is vague vs. golden standard's ""Setup-Anleitungen müssen 'zero-assumption' sein"")

10. **Reihenfolge Issue Not Fully Addressed:**
