4. ❌ Code examples with proper HTML/CSS structure — model provides none
5. ❌ Implementation guidance (JavaScript, testing) — model provides none
6. ❌ Semantic HTML alternatives (e.g., `<search>`, `<label>`, `.sr-only`) — model mentions some but not systematically
7. ❌ Live-region specifics (`aria-atomic=""false""`, `aria-relevant=""additions""`) — model completely misses this
8. ❌ Testing checklist — model provides none
9. ❌ F.I.R.S.T. principle or mnemonic — model provides none

### 4. **Specific Element-by-Element Gaps**

| Element | Model Output | Golden Standard | Gap |
