| Icon Button | ""Löschen"" | Full code with `aria-hidden`, `aria-describedby`, `.sr-only` hint | Missing SVG handling, destructive action warning |
| Dropdown | ""Statusfilter auswählen (ausgeklappt)"" | `aria-expanded`, `aria-haspopup=""listbox""`, semantic `<label>` | Missing state attribute, semantic structure |
| Search | ""Suche eingeben"" | `<search role=""search"">`, `.sr-only` label, scope definition | Missing semantic wrapper, scope clarity |
| Dark Mode | ""Dunkelmodus aktivieren (aktuell deaktiviert)"" | `aria-pressed=""false""` + JS implementation | Missing `aria-pressed` attribute, no JS guidance |
| Pagination | ""Nächste Seite (aktiv)"" | Dynamic label with page numbers, `<nav>` wrapper | Missing page count context, no dynamic template |
| Live-Ticker | ""Aktuelle Aktienkurse (live)"" | `aria-live=""polite""`, `aria-atomic=""false""`, `aria-relevant=""additions""` | **Critical miss**: No `aria-live` attribute mentioned |

### 5. **Critical Omissions**

1. **No WCAG citations**: Golden standard explicitly references WCAG 2.1 Level A (1.1.1, 4.1.2, 2.5.3)
