2. **Missing Feature→Benefit Mapping**:
   - The golden standard explicitly translates each feature into customer language with concrete outcomes (""Alle ziehen am gleichen Strang"", ""Dein nächstes Stakeholder-Meeting? Vorbereitet in 5 Minuten"")
