3. **Psychological Principles Not Cited**: The model mentions ""Endowed Progress Effect"" and ""Progressive Disclosure"" in the Begründung column, but doesn't provide the academic rigor of the golden standard (citations like ""Nunes & Drèze, 2006"", ""Sweller, 1988"", ""Kahneman et al., 1993"").

