   Model provides no overall scoring or metrics.

4. **Missing Roadmap/Prioritization Timeline**: Golden standard includes a detailed ""SPRINT 1-4"" roadmap with time estimates. Model only lists top 5 problems.

5. **Missing ROI Analysis**: Golden standard highlights the ""biggest ROI problem"" (Configuration section) with impact analysis. Model doesn't prioritize by business impact.

