**Golden Standard:**
- ""Kein Blabla"" – self-aware rejection of marketing speak (Berlin trademark)
- ""wenn's nötig ist"" – conversational contraction (authentic spoken German)
- ""tatsächlich funktionieren"" – understatement over hype (Berlin pragmatism)
- ""Versprochen."" – emotional directness (Berlin authenticity marker)
- Short, punchy sentences reflecting Berlin's minimalist creative aesthetic

**Verdict:** Model misses the cultural authenticity entirely.

### Tone & Voice
