- ✅ Docker Compose syntax: Uses `docker compose` (V2)
- ✅ Prisma commands: `npx prisma migrate deploy` and `npx prisma db seed` are correct
- ✅ Port assignments: 5173 (frontend), 4000 (backend), 5432 (db) are reasonable
- ✅ M1/M2 guidance: Rosetta 2 mention is appropriate
