|-----------|---|---|---|
| **ANALYSE length** | 3 sentences (dense) | 3 sentences (concise) | Minor: Model is slightly wordier |
| **Hook strength** | Good (23h statistic) | Excellent (provocative thesis + statistic) | Model's hook is informative but less emotionally charged |
| **Open Loops** | Present (3 instances) | Present (3+ instances) + psychological explanation | Model lacks the theoretical grounding |
