The response is **adequate for a standalone release notes document** (Score 3-4 range) but **fails to meet the task's specific requirements** for demonstrating the analytical methodology (Score 2-3 range). The task explicitly asks to ""liste zuerst explizit alle gefundenen Probleme auf (Schritt 1)"" with detailed categorization, which the model does not do to the standard's level.",23259.246917034034,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,2.0,4.0,2.0,stop,False,False,25000.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
