- Conduct a microcopy audit (Schritt 1: Analysis)
- Identify problems explicitly before optimization (Schritt 2)
- Keep analysis extremely compact (max. 3-4 sentences total)
- Provide optimization with clear reasoning
- Follow strict requirements (not provided in the prompt, but implied: plain language, WCAG compliance, tone consistency, medical safety)

