- ✅ Table format.
- ✅ Glossary.
- ✅ Color-coded severity (🔴/🟡/🔵).
- ✅ Emojis for scannability.
- ✅ HEART framework as a capstone.
- ✅ ""Golden rule"" for future decisions.

**Winner:** Golden Standard (better visual hierarchy, more memorable).

