- Missing the self-aware rejection of corporate speak (""Kein Blabla"")
- No understatement or ironic distance from marketing language
- Doesn't have the punchy, minimalist style of the golden standard
- ""Wir graben tief"" still echoes the original's ""deep-dive"" metaphor

## Standard Adherence Analysis

**Golden Standard Characteristics:**
1. Opens with direct problem-solving (""was wirklich gebraucht wird"")
2. Explicitly rejects corporate language (""Kein Blabla, keine halben Sachen"")
