- Model is more conventional/safer in tone
- Model lacks the explicit anti-corporate stance
- Model doesn't achieve the same level of Berlin street-credibility
- Model is competent but generic compared to the golden standard's distinctive voice
- The golden standard is significantly more authentic to Berlin agency culture

## Critical Issue: Format Violation

