**What the Model Does Well:**
- Completes both required steps (Analysis + Transformation)
- Identifies all missing elements correctly
- Delivers a functional, benefit-oriented hero section
- Includes Risk Reversal and emotional language appropriately
- Addresses target audience explicitly

