- Provides only single CTA (no secondary escape valve)
- Trust signals not isolated/highlighted as prominently
- No detailed reasoning for design choices
- Analysis is descriptive rather than diagnostic
- Missing visual/structural guidance for implementation
- Doesn't identify the core emotional pain point (""Chaos"") as explicitly

**Overall Quality:**
