|-----------|-------|--------|-----|
| Analysis Structure | Brief prose | Detailed table | Significant |
| Subject Line Strategy | Single option | Two options + reasoning | Moderate |
| Preview Text Quality | Weak hook | Strong narrative bridge | Moderate |
| CTA Specificity | Generic | Value-specific | Moderate |
