### Model Response Strengths

**Problem Identification (Step 1):**
- ✅ Organized into 4 categories with severity levels
- ✅ Uses clear table format with Problem/Severity columns
- ✅ Identifies 12 distinct issues across all categories
- ✅ Severity labels (Critical/High/Medium/Low) are present
- ✅ Concise problem statements

**Props Documentation (Step 2):**
- ✅ Complete props table with all required columns (Prop, Type, Required, Default, Description)
- ✅ Includes both `DataTableProps<T>` and `Column<T>` interfaces
