   - While the model's justifications are present, they're somewhat generic
   - The golden standard provides more specific references (RFC citations, concrete examples of why each problem matters)
   - Example: Model says ""Auth is a Security-Standard"" vs. Golden Standard's ""Production-API with 10,000+ Requests/Day without Auth documentation is a critical security risk""

