   - Model: ~8 error codes documented
   - Golden Standard: ~10 error codes with more detailed mapping

5. **Edge Cases Section**:
   - Model includes edge cases (empty items, invalid product ID, insufficient stock, duplicate order)
   - Golden standard integrates these more seamlessly into the main documentation
