### 1. **Task Compliance: Structure & Format Requirements**

**Required Elements:**
- ✅ ANALYSE section (Step 1) – Present and explicit
- ✅ TRANSFORMATION section (Step 2) – Complete Twitter thread
- ✅ EXPERT-LEVEL section (Step 3) – Open Loops and Engagement Question identified
- ✅ Thread numbering (1/x format) – Correctly implemented (1/10)
- ✅ Character limit adherence (≤280 chars) – **CRITICAL ISSUE HERE** (see below)
