- Target audience identified (Dev/User/Admin)
- Internal commits (refactor, style, docs) explicitly filtered out with justification

**Model Response:**
- No explicit commit-by-commit analysis
- Categories applied but without showing the mapping process
- No audience segmentation
- No filtering rationale for internal commits

---

