- Content assumes all readers need all information

---

#### 7. **Justification & Reasoning (Significant Gap)**

**Golden Standard:**
- Provides 8 detailed justifications explaining:
  - Why breaking changes come first
  - Why security precedes features
  - Why v3.0.0 is correct
