The model response successfully accomplishes all four primary objectives. Sarcasm is completely removed (""geniuses,"" ""horoscope,"" ""coffee break"" metaphors are all eliminated). Technical facts are preserved (database consistency issues, latency spikes, Friday deployment). The ""horoscope"" metaphor is correctly interpreted as ""unpredictable/unreliable."" The tone is professional throughout.

## Comparison to Golden Standard

**Structural Differences:**

The model response uses a simpler structure:
- INCIDENT SUMMARY
- TECHNICAL DETAILS
- IMMEDIATE RECOMMENDATION
- NEXT STEPS
- BUSINESS IMPACT

The golden standard uses:
