- Maintains professional information intact
- Appropriate greeting and closing formulas
- Grammatically correct German
- Follows the instruction to provide only the rewritten text

**Weaknesses:**
- Inconsistent capitalization of ""du/Du"" (violates modern German standard)
- Uses ""Dein Support-Team"" instead of ""Das Support-Team"" (personalizes when institutional distance is preferred)
