   - Golden standard uses ""Strategie überlegen"" which is more professional and idiomatic
   - Both convey ""game plan,"" but the golden standard is more appropriate for business context

2. **""kurz zusammensetzen""** vs. **""kurz zusammenkommen""**
   - Model: ""zusammensetzen"" (sit together) is acceptable but slightly less natural
   - Golden standard: ""zusammenkommen"" (come together) is more standard and natural
