- Professional tone maintained throughout
- No sarcasm or passive-aggressive language remains
- Technical accuracy preserved
- Clear problem-to-action flow

**Weaknesses:**
- Missing explicit severity/status metadata
- Passive closing statement instead of directive CTA
- Slightly less concise than golden standard
- Minor tone differences (slightly more emphatic than necessary)

## Standard Adherence

