| **Schlechtes Beispiel** | 20-field form | ✅ Concrete, shows problem |
| **Wann nutzen (Ja/Nein)** | Bullet list with clear Ja/Nein | ✅ Present, actionable |
| **Quick-Tipp** | ""Frag dich: Brauchen 80% der Nutzer das sofort?"" | ✅ Actionable, implementable |
| **No Jargon** | Avoids ""cognitive load"", ""IA"", ""decision paralysis"" | ✅ Clean language |
| **Simple sentences (max 15 words)** | Most sentences are short; some are longer | ⚠️ Minor issue (e.g., ""Erst *nach* deiner Eingabe erscheinen Filter, Bilder, News-Tabs"" = 11 words ✓) |
