- ✓ Attempts Berlin Agency authenticity

## Quality Assessment Against Golden Standard

**Strengths of Model Response:**
1. Successfully eliminates all corporate jargon
2. Uses direct, action-oriented language (""Dinge anders machen,"" ""Ergebnisse liefern"")
3. Includes authentic Berlin markers (""Kein Gelaber, kein Bullshit"")
4. Conversational tone with contractions and informal phrasing
