9. **Szenario 6 (Banking) – Tone Analysis:**
   - Model correctly identifies the problem but doesn't explain *why* ""Jetzt"" creates artificial urgency or how it undermines trust in high-value transactions.
   - Golden standard provides this context: ""Kein ‚Jetzt' – keine Dringlichkeit bei Finanzoperationen.""

### Structural Differences

| Aspect | Model | Golden Standard |
|--------|-------|-----------------|
| Analysis depth | 3 sentences, concise | Detailed table with 8 rows, each problem explained |
| Optimization table | 5 columns | 4 columns (more focused) |
| Szenario 7 handling | Vague, no synthesis | Full Prospect Theory analysis + synthesis + segmentation |
