- Progressive Disclosure is correctly applied
- Cognitive Load reduction is valid
- Self-Efficacy framing is appropriate
- Plain language principles are sound

**Psychological Validity:** ✅ Principles are correctly identified
- Endowed Progress Effect is real and applicable
- Cognitive Load Theory is correctly cited (though not formally)
- Self-Efficacy is the right construct

**UX Writing Quality:** ✅ Excellent
- ""Womit geht es los?"" is more engaging than ""Willkommen bei...""
- ""Gibt es Ausnahmen?"" is more conversational than ""Bedingungen (Conditional Logic)""
- ""Erledigt!"" with ""Routinearbeit abnehmen"" is emotionally resonant

---

