   - **Rate limiting headers incomplete**: The response mentions `X-RateLimit-Remaining` in the cURL example but doesn't document all three headers (`X-RateLimit-Limit`, `X-RateLimit-Remaining`, `X-RateLimit-Reset`) in a dedicated section
   - **Missing `X-Request-ID` header documentation**: Not mentioned in the improved version
   - **No `Retry-After` header for 429**: Mentioned in edge case but not in status codes table
   - **Incomplete error code reference**: Only shows 2 error codes vs. 10+ in golden standard
   - **No HATEOAS links**: Response doesn't include `_links` object for navigation

3. **Structural Issues**:
   - The improved documentation doesn't have a dedicated ""Response Headers"" section (golden standard has this)
   - No ""Best Practices"" section with explicit retry strategy and exponential backoff guidance
   - Error code reference table is missing (golden standard has comprehensive error code → solution mapping)
