| **Max 150 Wörter** | ⚠️ Approximately 165-170 words (exceeds limit) | ✅ ~148 words | Model: Below requirement |
| **Format: Überschrift + Kurz-Definition** | ✅ ""Progressive Disclosure (Schrittweise Enthüllung)"" + 1-Satz-Definition | ✅ ""🗂️ Progressive Disclosure"" + 1-Satz-Definition | Model: Excellent |
