## Summary

The **model response is solid and task-compliant** in most areas, but has one critical flaw: **word count exceeds the 150-word limit**. The golden standard, while more comprehensive and polished, **also violates the word count constraint even more severely**.

The model's approach of respecting the token-saving constraint in the analysis phase (2 sentences) while the golden standard ignores it suggests the model may have been more faithful to the original task brief.

**Key differentiators:**
