- Includes example: ""Welches Element testest du aktuell auf deiner Landingpage – Layout, Copy oder CTA?""
- Explains the deliverability mechanism (Safe Sender list) ✓
- Mentions segmentation potential ✓
- Word count: Adequate explanation

Golden Response:
