- Explains three layers: Deliverability (technical), Segmentation (strategic), Psychology (engagement) ✓
- Provides specific segmentation logic (Testing vs. Bauchgefühl groups) ✓
- Explains why binary choice reduces cognitive load ✓
- Includes 7 detailed justifications for all design decisions ✓

**Key Difference:** Golden standard provides 7 detailed justifications for every design choice (subject line, preview, body structure, CTA, PS, preview-text bridge, reply mechanic). Model response does not include these justifications.

**Verdict:** Model's micro-interaction is good and functional. However, it lacks the comprehensive justification framework that the golden standard provides.

---

