- ✓ Produces a functional, well-written newsletter
- ✓ Includes appropriate terminology and examples
- ✓ Explains the micro-interaction concept
- ✗ Lacks the structured analysis format
- ✗ Missing comprehensive justification framework
- ✗ Preview text could be stronger
- ✗ CTA could be more specific

The response would score higher if it included:
1. A structured analysis table
