5. More strategic explanation of information withholding

However, the core deliverables are solid and would function well as an actual newsletter.",22692.93233298231,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4.0,4.0,3.0,STOP,False,False,8192.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
