- Nicht nutzen: 3 specific cases (price comparison, checkout, transparency concerns)
- Quick-Tipp: ""Frag: 'Was braucht der Nutzer in diesem Moment – und was kann noch warten?'""

**Assessment:** Golden standard's table format is more scannable and professional. Golden standard's Quick-Tipp is more strategic (asks a question) vs. model's tactical approach (do this). Golden standard is stronger here.

---

### 3. FORMAT & STRUCTURE COMPLIANCE

