| Use-case guidance | ✓ | ✓ |
| Limitations/boundaries | ✓ | ✓ |
| Quick-Tipp | ✓ | ✓ |

**Assessment:** Model meets ALL format requirements. Golden standard adds visual polish (emojis, table formatting) but model is compliant.

