### 4. INFORMATION FIDELITY & ACCURACY

Both responses accurately convey the concept of Progressive Disclosure:
- Show essential info first ✓
- Hide advanced/secondary features ✓
- Reveal on demand ✓
- Reduces cognitive overload ✓

