### 1. ANALYSE SECTION (Step 1)

**Model Response:**
- 4 bullet points identifying missing elements (Hook, Timing, Visuals, Spoken Word, Retention-Hooks, Pattern-Interrupts, Editor-Plan, CTA/Community-Bindung)
- Compact, direct, meets the ""max 3-4 sentences"" instruction
