- Timestamps are present and functional

**Golden Standard:**
- Uses section headers with time ranges: [00:00 – 00:18] HOOK, [00:18 – 00:50] WHAT IS 2FA?, etc.
- Clearer visual hierarchy
- Timestamps are equally present but formatted more professionally

**Verdict:** Both meet the timing requirement. Golden standard has slightly better formatting/readability.

---

