- Golden Standard: Expert-level (frameworks, evidence, legal, psychology, segmentation)
- Model: Competent-level (structure, basic optimization, generic reasoning)",24094.394084007945,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,3.0,3.0,2.0,stop,False,False,8192.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
