  - **H2 (High):** `onRowClick` event signature incomplete (missing `index` and `event` parameters) – Model doesn't mention this at all
  - **H3 (High):** Sorting hierarchy between table-level and column-level `sortable` – Model doesn't address this interaction
  - **H4 (High):** `pageSize` behavior when `pagination={false}` – Not mentioned
