|--------|---|---|
| Gender neutrality | ✓ Achieved | ✓ Achieved |
| Removal of toxic terms | ✓ Complete | ✓ Complete |
| Tone | Professional, somewhat formal | Professional, warm, inviting |
| Emotional appeal | Moderate | Higher (uses ""Tatkraft,"" ""Leidenschaft,"" ""Begeisterung"") |
