## Standard Adherence

The model response is approximately 85-90% aligned with the golden standard. The two substantive differences (""unterstützen"" vs. ""helfen"" and ""Viele Grüße"" vs. ""Liebe Grüße"") are not errors per se, but they represent suboptimal choices for the specific context of informal German business communication. The golden standard's explanations make clear that these are conventional preferences in German business writing.

