5. ⚠️ Metrics/scoring: 0% (missing quantification)
6. ⚠️ Prioritization structure: 50% (list vs. sprint roadmap)

**Verdict**: This is a **Score 4** response. It meets core requirements excellently but misses important presentation and structural elements that distinguish a ""good"" response from an ""excellent"" one. The golden standard's tabular format, emoji indicators, numerical scoring, and sprint roadmap are not just cosmetic—they're part of professional documentation evaluation standards.",17479.108624975197,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4.0,4.0,3.0,stop,False,False,25000.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
