The golden standard represents a higher bar for modern German job advertising that balances professionalism with inclusivity and warmth.",13508.33129097009,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,5.0,3.0,3.0,stop,False,False,25000.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,100/100,100/100,,,,,,,,
