**Weaknesses:**
- Incomplete Step 3 optimization (missing action-selection UI)
- No quantitative metrics for stakeholder communication
- Less rigorous psychological grounding
- Missing visual/structural elements (severity labels, narrative flow diagram)
- Doesn't fully implement the principles it names (e.g., progress indicators mentioned but not shown in copy)

