- **Maintains token efficiency:** ✅ Yes
- **Matches depth of analysis:** ⚠️ Partial (4 problems vs. 8)
- **Includes implementation details:** ⚠️ Partial (reasoning mentions details not in copy)
- **Provides stakeholder metrics:** ❌ No

The response demonstrates solid UX writing competence but falls short of the expert-level rigor and completeness shown in the golden standard.

---

## Final Assessment

