4. ❌ **No JavaScript implementation details** — doesn't show how to update `aria-pressed` dynamically
5. ❌ **Generic pagination** — doesn't include dynamic page numbers in label
6. ❌ **No testing guidance** — no mention of screen reader testing (NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver)
7. ❌ **No enterprise patterns** — missing `.sr-only` class, destructive action warnings
