| **Search scope** | ""Globale Suche"" | Includes `<search role=""search"">` + scope clarification | Missing semantic wrapper |
| **Implementation checklist** | Not provided | Includes screen reader testing checklist | Missing |
| **F.I.R.S.T. principle** | Not mentioned | Provided as mnemonic aid | Missing pedagogical value |

### 3. **Output Quality**

