- 11 sections with clear hierarchy
- Includes: Quick Start, Prerequisites, Repo clone, Structure, .env config, Services start, DB init, Validation, Stop/Reset, Troubleshooting, Next Steps
- Comprehensive .env.example with comments
- 6 detailed troubleshooting scenarios
