| **Expert-Level Depth** | Basic micro-interaction | 3-layer analysis (tech/strategic/psychological) | Significant |
| **Reasoning/Justification** | Minimal | Comprehensive (7 detailed points) | Significant |

## Key Strengths of Model Response
1. Completes all three required steps
2. Newsletter is well-written, conversational, and emotionally engaging
3. Respects word count and format requirements
4. Includes A/B test variant for subject line
5. Micro-interaction is present and functional
6. No major factual errors or tone mismatches

## Key Weaknesses vs. Golden Standard
1. **CTA lacks specificity** – ""Full Case Study lesen"" vs. ""Jetzt Case Study lesen – inkl. der 3 konkreten Test-Setups""
2. **Micro-interaction lacks strategic depth** – No explanation of deliverability mechanics, segmentation strategy, or psychological reasoning
