Evaluating the actual German translation provided:

**Comparison with Golden Standard:**

1. **""went south"" → ""schiefgelaufen"" vs. ""den Bach runtergegangen""**
   - Model: ""schiefgelaufen"" (went wrong/failed)
   - Golden: ""den Bach runtergegangen"" (went down the creek)
