- Severity level
- Status field
- Numbered issue structure
- Explicit ""Recommended Action"" section
- Explicit CTA closing
- ""Reported By"" field

These omissions are not critical failures but represent gaps in executive-level incident report formatting standards.

## Overall Assessment

