| Spoken-word naturalness | Excellent | Excellent | Tie |
| Timestamp coverage | Complete | Complete | Tie |
| Production-cue specificity | Adequate | Detailed | Golden Standard |

---

### Strengths of Model Response

1. **Follows instructions precisely** – Provides analysis, transformation, and Easter Egg as requested
2. **Conversational tone** – German dialogue feels natural and engaging
3. **Complete coverage** – All required sections (Intro, Prerequisites, 4 Steps, Troubleshooting, Conclusion, Easter Egg)
