A user could use this script to produce a functional tutorial video. However, the golden standard would produce a *more engaging* video with better retention and community engagement.",23633.973874966618,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4.0,4.0,3.0,STOP,False,False,8192.0,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
