### 1. ANALYSE SECTION (Step 1)

**Model Response:**
- Provides a narrative paragraph identifying missing elements (Subject Line, Preview Text, Hook, Storytelling, CTA)
- Mentions the problem but lacks structure and specificity
- Does NOT follow the instruction to be ""extrem kurz und präzise (maximal 2-3 Sätze)""
