| can't afford to drop the ball | ""keinen Patzer erlauben"" | ""können es uns nicht leisten, einen Fehler zu machen"" | Model uses ""Patzer"" (colloquial for blunder); golden standard uses more formal business language. The golden standard better preserves the ""can't afford"" semantic component. |

