- ❌ Missing all structural elements (tables, analysis, justifications)
- ❌ Missing all content depth (psychological principles, legal compliance, character counts, segmentation strategies)
- ❌ Missing all expert-level reasoning

### Severity Assessment

This is not a case of ""minor omissions"" or ""slightly off-target."" The response is **fundamentally broken**:
- The model failed to complete the task
- A system error (infinite loop) prevented output delivery
- The user receives no actionable content
- The response demonstrates zero progress toward the stated goal

