| **Problem #8 (Passive Sprache)** | Explicitly identified | Not mentioned | Missing |
| **Step 3 Optimization** | Correctly identifies that Step 3 still requires action selection + celebration | Frames Step 3 as completion announcement | **Fundamental misunderstanding** |
| **Psychological Principles** | 6 principles with citations, empirical data, narrative flow analysis | 4 principles without citations or empirical grounding | Missing depth and rigor |
| **Peak-End Rule Application** | Detailed explanation with Kahneman reference | Not mentioned | Missing |
| **Choice Architecture** | Explicit discussion of autonomy and skip buttons | Not mentioned | Missing |
| **Concrete Examples** | 3 examples per step | 1 example per step | Fewer examples |
| **Word Count Targets** | ≤35 / ≤35 / ≤40 words per step | Not explicitly tracked | Missing optimization metric |
| **Validation Section** | Includes A/B-test metrics and schätzwerte | Not included | Missing |
| **Narrative Flow Analysis** | Explicit ""Wenn→Nur wenn→Dann"" narrative structure | Implicit, not articulated | Missing conceptual framework |

