| **Alltagsmetapher (Kochen/Verkehr)** | ✅ Wardrobe/closet metaphor (visual, relatable) | ✅ Kitchen/cooking metaphor (more dynamic, process-oriented) | Both present; golden standard's cooking metaphor is more action-oriented |
| **Concrete UX examples** | ✅ Generic ""App shows main functions"" + ""All buttons at once"" | ✅ Gmail specific example + 12-field form | Golden standard uses real, recognizable apps |
