| **Use-case section** | ✅ ""Wann nutzen?"" present | ✅ Yes/No table format | Golden standard more structured |
| **Limitations/Grenzen** | ✅ ""Wann lieber nicht?"" present | ✅ Explicit ""Nein ❌"" column | Both present |
