### 4. ADHERENCE TO TASK INSTRUCTIONS

The task explicitly asks for:
1. ✅ ANALYSE (Schritt 1) – Model provides this, though more briefly than golden standard
2. ✅ TRANSFORMATION (Schritt 2) – Model provides this
