- ""Max 150 Wörter"" for transformation – Model: ~120 words ✓; Golden standard: ~148 words ✓

**Observation:** The model actually followed the token-efficiency instruction more literally than the golden standard. However, the golden standard provides additional value (justifications, before/after comparison) that goes beyond the stated requirements.

---

### 5. CRITICAL GAPS IN MODEL RESPONSE

