1. **`-mtime +1` interpretation**: The script uses `-mtime +1` to find files modified more than 1 day ago. This is correct for ""old files,"" though the task doesn't explicitly specify age. The golden standard lists `-mtime +30` as banned, which is confusing—it may mean ""don't hardcode 30"" (which the script doesn't; it's configurable).

