- Provides extensive step-by-step analysis
- Considers multiple alternative explanations (N+1 queries, caching issues, frontend processing)
- Offers comprehensive solutions across three time horizons (immediate, short-term, long-term)
- Includes specific tools (pg_stat_statements, slow query log)
- Well-structured with clear sections and tables

**Model Response Weaknesses:**
