- Includes multiple diagnostic approaches

**Weaknesses of Model Response:**
- Doesn't explicitly identify the measurement gap as the central insight
- More verbose without proportional added value
- Doesn't prioritize the diagnostic step (measure full lifecycle) as clearly
- Language mismatch with golden standard (English vs. German)
- Somewhat scattered explanation of the 20ms vs. 5-10s contradiction

**Overall Assessment:**
