- API response time of 20ms doesn't contradict slow user experience ✓
- N+1 query problem is a likely culprit ✓
- Missing indexes are a probable cause ✓
- Caching is a valid solution ✓
- EXPLAIN ANALYZE is the right diagnostic tool ✓

