- Task compliance (all three deliverables present)
- Technical correctness (no major errors)
- Clarity and presentation (well-structured, visual aids)

The response would score slightly lower on:
- Architectural principle emphasis (vs. implementation details)
- Conciseness (somewhat verbose)
- Explicit durability guarantees (WAL-first ordering)

