The model response addresses the same core problem but with less rigor in proof, fewer worked examples, and less comprehensive explanation of the reasoning process.",10062.959249946289,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,5.0,4.0,3.0,end_turn,False,False,8192.0,,7.5/100,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,12.5/100,,,,,,,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,0.0,,,,,,
