- ✅ Identifies the problem correctly
- ✅ Explains why it happens
- ⚠️ Provides solutions but lacks depth and rigor
- ❌ Missing formal Coffman conditions analysis
- ❌ Missing tool recommendations
- ❌ Missing risk analysis for proposed solutions
- ❌ Missing implementation examples

### Overall Quality

