**Completeness:** Good but not excellent. The core calculation is complete, but contextual understanding and deeper insights are missing.

**Accuracy:** Excellent. All numerical values and mathematical reasoning are correct.

**Confidence Assessment:** The stated 95% confidence is appropriate and well-justified based on the established nature of this problem.

## Standard Adherence

