The task requires scheduling three 1-hour meetings within a 1:00 PM – 3:00 PM window (2 hours total) with no overlaps and all completed by 3:00 PM. This is a constraint satisfaction problem with a mathematical impossibility: 3 hours of meetings cannot fit into a 2-hour window.

## Model Response Evaluation

### Strengths of the Model Response:
