## Comparison: Model Response vs. Golden Standard

### Critical Difference: Compliance with Format Requirements

**Golden Standard:**
- Uses `<thought>` tags with detailed step-by-step reasoning in German
- Explores the logic systematically (verification of both cases)
- Provides multiple alternative formulations
