The response would score as ""Good"" (4) rather than ""Excellent"" (5) because:
- It correctly identifies the root cause
- It provides good reasoning and solutions
- But it misses the critical insight about measurement gaps
- And it doesn't emphasize the diagnostic approach as strongly as the golden standard",12906.89166705124,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,True,hybrid,4.0,4.0,4.0,STOP,False,False,8192.0,,,,,,,,,,,30.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,20.0/100,,,20.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,0.0,,,,,,
