1. **Missing explicit categorical distinction** between pre-commit and post-commit async work (though implicitly understood)
2. **Insufficient depth on distributed systems concerns**: No discussion of WAL ordering, delivery guarantees, idempotency, crash recovery
3. **No visual diagrams** to illustrate the architecture
