2. **Presentation:** The model uses prose format throughout. The golden standard uses a table and structured format that makes the comparison more visually clear.
3. **Alternative formulations:** While the model mentions ""If I were to ask you if this door leads to freedom, would you say yes?"" it doesn't fully explore why this alternative works (it actually does work, though the model's analysis of it was incomplete).

### Alignment with Golden Standard
