- Identify the correct question
- Explain the double-inversion mechanism
- Conclude that you should choose the opposite door
- Provide clear logical verification

The main difference is presentation style and conciseness. The golden standard is more elegant and structured; the model is more exploratory and detailed.

### Overall Assessment
