|---|---|---|---|
| SQL Injection (Login) | Critical | Critical | ✓ |
| Plaintext Passwords | Critical | Critical | ✓ |
| SQL Injection (Reset) | Critical | Critical | ✓ |
| SQL Injection (Delete) | Critical | Critical | ✓ |
