| XSS (Welcome) | High | High | ✓ |
| CSRF | Medium | High | ✗ |
| Unencrypted Cookie | Medium | Medium | ✓ |
| Debug Output | Medium | Medium | ✓ |

**Severity Misclassifications**: 
- 4 vulnerabilities downgraded from Critical to High (Path Traversal, Type Juggling, Cookie Admin, IDOR)
- 2 vulnerabilities downgraded from High to Medium (Session Fixation, CSRF)

This represents a **systematic underestimation of severity** for privilege escalation and authentication bypass vulnerabilities.

