The golden standard identifies **19 vulnerabilities** across all categories:
- **Critical (7)**: SQL Injection (3x), Path Traversal, Type Juggling, Admin Cookie, IDOR
- **High (7)**: XSS, Weak Token, Session Fixation, Hardcoded Secret, DB Credentials, CSRF, Mail Header Injection
