- SQL Injection (Delete): Listed as ""High"" but should be ""Critical"" (full data destruction)
- Path Traversal: Listed as ""High"" but should be ""Critical"" (system file access)
- Loose Comparison: Listed as ""High"" but should be ""Critical"" (authentication bypass)

### Quality Assessment

