   - The model rates ""Offscreen images load eagerly"" as **Mittel** (Medium) - this is reasonable but the golden standard treats below-the-fold image loading as lower priority
   - ""Content-visibility"" suggestion is rated **Niedrig** - appropriate, but this is a micro-optimization

