- No CSS fix showing contrast-compliant color values with actual ratios
- No testing checklist
- No prioritization matrix
- No discussion of Windows High Contrast Mode
- No JavaScript solution for live regions
- No `.sr-only` utility class definition

**Accuracy Issues:**
