- SQL Injection (Login): Critical ✓
- Plaintext Passwords: Critical ✓
- IDOR: Critical ✓
- Privilege Escalation (Cookie): Critical ✓
- Path Traversal: Critical ✓
- SQL Injection (Reset & Admin): Critical ✓
