  - **#9**: Focus order problems with nested focusable elements
  - **#14**: Use of color alone to communicate discount (WCAG 1.4.1)
  - **#15**: Language of parts issue (English ""4 stars"" in German UI)
  - **#16**: Missing `type=""button""` attribute
  - **#18**: Pointer cancellation issue (onclick firing on nested elements)
  - **#20**: Focus not obscured (WCAG 2.2 new criterion)

**Assessment:** The model captures ~55% of the issues. It misses several subtle but important violations, particularly around semantic HTML, language attributes, and WCAG 2.2 new criteria.

---

### 2. **Accuracy of WCAG Criterion Citations**

**Model Response:**
- Correctly cites WCAG criteria (1.1.1, 2.4.7, 1.4.3, 2.4.4, 1.3.1, 2.5.8, 4.1.3)
