- Issue #9: Focus Order problems with nested interactive elements (2.4.3) — **CRITICAL**
- Issue #10: Link purpose ""Mehr"" without context (2.4.4) — **HIGH**
- Issue #12: Emoji as sole visual signal (1.3.3) — **HIGH**
