### 1. ANALYSE Section (Step 1)

**Model Response:**
- Lists 4 bullet points identifying missing elements (Hook, Thread-Formatierung, Engagement-Elemente)
- Explicitly names ""Hook,"" ""Thread-Formatierung,"" and ""Engagement-Elemente""
