  Klarheit > Verfügbarkeit.
  ```
- Explicitly designed for screenshot sharing
- Parallel structure makes it highly shareable

**Assessment:** Golden standard treats quotability as a design principle; model includes it incidentally.

---

### 8. Engagement Question (Final Tweet)

