```
""Was ist das sinnloseste recurring Meeting in deinem Kalender, 
das du morgen canceln könntest?""
```
- Highly specific and personal
- Easy to answer (everyone has an answer)
- Lowers cognitive barrier to reply
- Explicitly invites conversation (""Ich lese alles"")

**Assessment:** Golden standard's engagement question is significantly more effective at driving replies.

---

### 9. Tone & Voice

**Model Response:**
- Maintains informative, balanced tone
- Some enthusiasm but relatively formal
- Doesn't fully embrace ""meinungsstark, leicht provokativ"" instruction

**Golden Standard:**
- Provocative opening (""Meetings sind ein kollektives Eingeständnis..."")
